</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">THE BLINDING VALE · MYTHIC+ · ROGUE FIELD CARD</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">潜行者</span><span class="dot">·</span>夺目谷 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">这个副本的伤害大多是<b>全团的自然和神圣范围伤害</b>，外加一串击退。贼要做好三件事：<b>佯攻几乎常驻</b>，顶住践踏、咆哮和渗流木质；<b>被击退就暗影步</b>回到目标身后；<b>暗影斗篷</b>留给基岩涌动、光狂疯乱后的唤棘者咆哮和叠高的光绽之力。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+24 限时敏锐贼 ×3</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>欺诈者</b></span>
      <span class="chip">适用 <b>佯攻 / 斗篷 / 暗影步 / 闪避 / 疾跑 三系通用</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里关键技能交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一整场 +24 里，暗影斗篷和几个关键减伤、位移交在了哪里。金色是斗篷，灰色是其他技能。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
      <div class="tl">
        <div class="band trash" style="left:0.8%;width:15%">小怪 · 开场</div>
        <div class="band boss"  style="left:15.9%;width:15.8%">莱克希议会</div>
        <div class="band trash" style="left:32.1%;width:4.8%">小怪</div>
        <div class="band boss"  style="left:37%;width:15.3%">伊库兹</div>
        <div class="band boss"  style="left:54.1%;width:17.4%">鲁伊亚</div>
        <div class="band trash" style="left:72.7%;width:14%">小怪 · 薯身蟾</div>
        <div class="band boss"  style="left:86.7%;width:13.2%">兹欧凯特</div>

        <div class="axis" style="left:0;transform:none">0:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:17.86%">5:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:35.71%">10:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:53.57%">15:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:71.43%">20:00</div>
        <div class="axis" style="left:89.29%">25:00</div>

        <div class="mk dn" style="left:16.43%"><span class="lab">清基岩涌动</span><span class="t">4:36</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk up muted" style="left:19.35%"><span class="lab">低血消失</span><span class="t">5:25</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:1856}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk dn" style="left:24.48%"><span class="lab">清基岩涌动</span><span class="t">6:51</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk up muted" style="left:37.62%"><span class="lab">每次践踏后暗影步</span><span class="t">10:32 起</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:36554}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk dn" style="left:46.13%"><span class="lab">免疫咆哮 + 光狂疯乱</span><span class="t">12:55</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk up muted" style="left:50%"><span class="lab">闪避顶咆哮</span><span class="t">14:00</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:5277}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk up" style="left:77.26%"><span class="lab">清喷毒</span><span class="t">21:38</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk dn muted" style="left:90.82%"><span class="lab">疾跑接光球</span><span class="t">25:25</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:2983}}" alt=""></div>
        <div class="mk up end" style="left:97.62%"><span class="lab">免疫渗流木质</span><span class="t">27:20</span><span class="stem"></span><img src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i style="background:rgba(242,210,75,.25);border:1px solid var(--gold-dim)"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i style="background:var(--panel-2);border:1px dashed var(--line)"></i>小怪段</span>
      <span><i style="background:var(--gold);border-radius:50%"></i>暗影斗篷</span>
      <span><i style="background:var(--faint);border-radius:50%"></i>其他技能</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>先学这四招</h2>
  <p class="sub">每把都要做到的四个按键。</p>
  <div class="moments">
    <article class="mo">
      <div class="where">首领 1 · 莱克希议会</div>
      <div class="sig">看到<b>梅提克的基岩猛击砸下</b></div>
      <div class="act"><span class="arrow">→</span><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-clr">自解</span></div>
      <p>猛击落地后全团上 8 秒的基岩涌动。开斗篷一次清掉，顺带免疫地上的肥沃壤土。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="mo">
      <div class="where">首领 2 · 伊库兹</div>
      <div class="sig">看到<b>青翠践踏读条</b></div>
      <div class="act"><span class="arrow">→</span><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 → <img class="ic lg" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步</div>
      <p>读条末尾开佯攻顶践踏，被击退落地马上暗影步回首领背后。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="mo">
      <div class="where">首领 2 · 伊库兹 · 光狂疯乱后</div>
      <div class="sig">看到<b>唤棘者咆哮读条</b></div>
      <div class="act"><span class="arrow">→</span><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-imm">免疫</span></div>
      <p>首领吸收光绽后，咆哮和光狂疯乱的脉冲叠在一起，第一跳下来就开斗篷，后面几跳全免疫。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="mo">
      <div class="where">首领 4 · 兹欧凯特</div>
      <div class="sig">看到<b>光绽精华光球飘向首领</b></div>
      <div class="act"><span class="arrow">→</span><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:2983}}" alt="">疾跑 <span class="pill p-mv">接球</span></div>
      <p>光球碰到首领会触发荧光迸发。疾跑过去用身体接住，换一层光绽之力（增伤 10%）。叠太高就用斗篷清掉。</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>伊库兹：践踏的 4 秒节奏</h2>
  <div class="finding">
    <div>
      <h3><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">佯攻 → 践踏 → 暗影步</h3>
      <p>伊库兹的<b>青翠践踏</b>读条 3.5 秒，落地对全团造成物理伤害并把人击退。读条最后半秒按<b>佯攻</b>：6 秒的范围减伤正好盖住这一下，后面接着的咆哮也能吃到。</p>
      <p>被击退一落地就<b>暗影步</b>回到首领背后，不用跑回去，输出不断。天赋「蹈厉奋发」给暗影步多一次充能，每次践踏都有得用。</p>
      <p>践踏 4 秒后，你所在的位置会长出<b>血棘之根</b>。真被定住就交斗篷（魔法效果，直接清掉），斗篷在冷却就用消失（解除移动限制）。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bars" role="img" aria-label="青翠践踏一轮：读条 3.5 秒，结束前半秒开佯攻，落地击退后 0.4 秒暗影步，4 秒后长出血棘之根">
      <div class="cap">一次青翠践踏（以践踏落地为 0 秒）</div>
      <div class="cyc">
        <div class="lane enemy" style="top:0;left:5.56%;width:38.89%">青翠践踏 读条 3.5 秒</div>
        <div class="lane fe" style="top:34px;left:38.89%;width:61.11%">佯攻 6 秒 · 范围伤害 −40%</div>
        <div class="lane mv" style="top:68px;left:48.89%;width:22.22%">暗影步 移速 +70%</div>
        <div class="vl hit" style="left:44.44%"><b>践踏 + 击退</b></div>
        <div class="vl step" style="left:48.89%"><b>落地即暗影步</b></div>
        <div class="vl root" style="left:88.89%"><b>脚下长根</b></div>
        <div class="base"></div>
        <span class="tick" style="left:11.11%">−3</span>
        <span class="tick" style="left:22.22%">−2</span>
        <span class="tick" style="left:33.33%">−1</span>
        <span class="tick" style="left:44.44%">0</span>
        <span class="tick" style="left:55.56%">+1</span>
        <span class="tick" style="left:66.67%">+2</span>
        <span class="tick" style="left:77.78%">+3</span>
        <span class="tick" style="left:88.89%">+4 秒</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">04</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">每一行：看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。</p>
  <div class="route">

    <div class="stop trash">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 莱克希议会</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 鞭笞者大波</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1255205}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">拔根而起</div><div class="s">读条，你脚下冒根须 <span class="tag poison">自然</span><span class="tag">击退</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-imm">免疫</span></div>
          <div class="why">斗篷好的时候读条中预开，这一下直接不吃</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1255205}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">拔根而起</div><div class="s">已被击退</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">落地立刻回到怪堆里</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1263628}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">喷涌之花</div><div class="s">花朵读条 6 秒 <span class="tag magic">神圣</span><span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">60 码范围伤害，躲不开只能减</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1235865}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">荆棘之刃</div><div class="s">被背刺、低血 <span class="tag bleed">流血</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">流血是单体伤害，靠飘忽不定的 20% 减伤顶</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">这一大波拉得很长，佯攻有两次充能，<b>拔根而起和喷涌之花一来就按</b>，不用省。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop boss">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>莱克希议会</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1 · 莱克希 / 科兹齐特 / 梅提克</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1276586}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">基岩涌动</div><div class="s">基岩猛击落地后 <span class="tag poison">自然</span><span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-clr">自解</span></div>
          <div class="why">清掉 8 秒持续伤害，顺带免疫肥沃壤土</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1276586}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">基岩涌动</div><div class="s">斗篷在冷却</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 + <img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避</div>
          <div class="why">佯攻减 40%，闪避再叠飘忽不定的 20%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1276586}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">基岩涌动 + 荆棘之刃</div><div class="s">血量掉到两成</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1856}}" alt="">消失 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">天赋隐匿无踪：消失后 8 秒受到伤害降低 10%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">基岩涌动每轮猛击都来。斗篷 2 分钟一次，<b>一轮交斗篷、下一轮交佯攻 + 闪避</b>，交替着顶。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop trash">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>莱克希 → 伊库兹</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 短波</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1255205}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">拔根而起</div><div class="s">被击退 <span class="tag">击退</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">和开场一样，落地就回</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1263628}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">喷涌之花</div><div class="s">花朵读条 <span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">顶范围伤害</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop boss">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>圣光猎手伊库兹</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1236746}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">青翠践踏</div><div class="s">读条 3.5 秒 <span class="tag">全团</span><span class="tag">击退</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">读条最后半秒开，盖住践踏</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1236746}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">青翠践踏</div><div class="s">被击退落地</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">瞬间回到首领背后</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1236709}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">唤棘者咆哮</div><div class="s">6 秒每 2 秒一跳 <span class="tag poison">自然</span><span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 + <img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避</div>
          <div class="why">一跳比一跳疼，两层减伤一起叠</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1237073}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光狂疯乱 + 咆哮</div><div class="s">首领吸收光绽后 <span class="tag magic">神圣</span><span class="tag">脉冲</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-imm">免疫</span></div>
          <div class="why">5 秒内咆哮和脉冲全免疫</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1259365}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">血棘之根</div><div class="s">被定在原地 <span class="tag magic">魔法</span><span class="tag">定身</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">斗篷 / <img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1856}}" alt="">消失</div>
          <div class="why">斗篷连伤害一起清，消失只解定身</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note warn"><b>注意：</b>斗篷<b>留到光狂疯乱阶段的咆哮</b>。这时候咆哮一跳能打掉半管血，前面的普通咆哮用佯攻 + 闪避顶。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop boss">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>护光者鲁伊亚</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3 · 含门口的脊盾甲虫</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1238581}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">尖刺盾牌</div><div class="s">脊盾甲虫开盾 <span class="tag magic">魔法</span><span class="tag">反伤</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-imm">免疫</span></div>
          <div class="why">每一击的反伤都免疫，放心 AOE 打盾</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1239825}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光明之火</div><div class="s">被光束点名 6 秒 <span class="tag magic">神圣</span><span class="tag">点名</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">单体持续伤害，飘忽不定减 20%，盖满 6 秒</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1241058}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">凶残痛击</div><div class="s">挥击后叠流血 <span class="tag bleed">流血</span><span class="tag">叠加</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">有飘忽不定，佯攻也减 20% 单体伤害</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">光明之火结束时会在你脚下留一道射线，<b>闪避开着也要走出去</b>。凶残痛击回满血就会消失，治疗刷满之前别贪站位。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop trash">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>鲁伊亚 → 兹欧凯特</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 薯身蟾主母</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1250937}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">喷毒</div><div class="s">主母读条 <span class="tag poison">自然</span><span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">顶住首击</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1250937}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">喷毒</div><div class="s">9 秒毒液上身</div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-clr">自解</span></div>
          <div class="why">清掉后面 6 跳毒伤，治疗省一次驱散</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">斗篷在这里交掉没关系，<b>到兹欧凯特的光球阶段正好转好</b>。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stop boss">
      <div class="node">4</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>兹欧凯特</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 4</span></div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247644}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">渗流木质</div><div class="s">每 3 秒一跳 <span class="tag magic">神圣</span><span class="tag">全团</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1966}}" alt="">佯攻 <span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div>
          <div class="why">整场的底伤，两次充能轮着按</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246858}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光绽精华</div><div class="s">光球飘向首领 <span class="tag">接球</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:2983}}" alt="">疾跑 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">抢在光球碰到首领前接住，换增伤</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247052}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光绽之力</div><div class="s">层数叠高、低血 <span class="tag magic">神圣</span><span class="tag">叠加</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:31224}}" alt="">暗影斗篷 <span class="pill p-clr">自解</span></div>
          <div class="why">清掉所有层，同时免疫渗流木质</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247669}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">光孢射击</div><div class="s">光诞鞭笞者喷吐 <span class="tag magic">神圣</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:5277}}" alt="">闪避 / <img class="ic sm" src="{{I:2094}}" alt="">致盲</div>
          <div class="why">叠光绽之力时闪避减伤，致盲先控住一只</div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247746}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">棘刺</div><div class="s">被刺穿击退 <span class="tag bleed">流血</span><span class="tag">击退</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="to">→</div>
          <div class="skill"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:36554}}" alt="">暗影步 <span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div>
          <div class="why">落地回到首领身边</div>
        </div>
        <div class="note">光绽之力每层都有持续伤害。<b>接球前看一眼层数</b>，叠到吃不消再接就先斗篷清空。</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">05</span>工具箱</h2>
  <p class="sub">金框是这个副本的核心技能。</p>
  <div class="tools">
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1966}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">佯攻</div><span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>青翠践踏、唤棘者咆哮、渗流木质、喷涌之花、喷毒、凶残痛击</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>范围伤害读条末尾，两次充能几乎常驻</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:31224}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">暗影斗篷</div><span class="pill p-imm">免疫 · 自解</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>基岩涌动、光狂疯乱后的咆哮、光绽之力、喷毒、血棘之根、尖刺盾牌</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>持续伤害上身后清，或大读条预开</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool star">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:36554}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">暗影步</div><span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>青翠践踏、拔根而起、棘刺的击退</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>被击退一落地</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:5277}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">闪避</div><span class="pill p-dr">减伤</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>光明之火、唤棘者咆哮、基岩涌动、荆棘之刃、光孢射击</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>斗篷没好、或单体持续伤害上身</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:2983}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">疾跑</div><span class="pill p-mv">位移</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>兹欧凯特的光绽精华光球</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>光球刚刷出来</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:1856}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">消失</div><span class="pill p-dr">减伤 · 解定身</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>基岩涌动下的低血、血棘之根</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>血量见底，或被定身而斗篷在冷却</dd></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="tool">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:2094}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">致盲</div><span class="pill p-mv">控制</span></div></div>
      <dl class="dl"><dt>顶什么</dt><dd>兹欧凯特场上的光诞鞭笞者</dd><dt>时机</dt><dd>鞭笞者开始喷光孢射击</dd></dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2><span class="k">06</span>身上常中的减益</h2>
  <div class="tbl-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>减益</th><th>类型</th><th>自己能解吗</th><th>一般怎么处理</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1276586}}" alt="">基岩涌动</div></td><td><span class="tag poison">自然</span><span class="tag">全团</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷</td><td>8 秒每秒一跳，驱散不掉，治疗刷</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1259365}}" alt="">血棘之根</div></td><td><span class="tag magic">魔法</span><span class="tag">定身</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷 <span class="no">/ 消失只解定身</span></td><td>奶骑清洁术、自由祝福，战士冲锋脱出</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1250937}}" alt="">喷毒</div></td><td><span class="tag poison">中毒</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷</td><td>奶骑清洁术、萨满清毒</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1247052}}" alt="">光绽之力</div></td><td><span class="tag magic">神圣</span><span class="tag">叠加</span></td><td class="yes">✓ 暗影斗篷</td><td>接光球换增伤，层数太高时清掉</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1239825}}" alt="">光明之火</div></td><td><span class="tag magic">神圣</span><span class="tag">点名</span></td><td><span class="no">✗</span> 闪避减伤</td><td>6 秒后脚下留射线，结束前走开</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1235865}}" alt="">荆棘之刃</div></td><td><span class="tag bleed">流血</span></td><td><span class="no">✗</span> 闪避减伤</td><td>12 秒流血，治疗跟刷</td></tr>
        <tr><td><div class="dname"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1241058}}" alt="">凶残痛击</div></td><td><span class="tag bleed">流血</span><span class="tag">叠加</span></td><td class="no">✗</td><td>佯攻减伤，血量回满自动消失</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

